# FG-23 A0 runs the app from the main checkout, so its deployed env file — the
# session-signing key and the agent_home_app DATABASE_URL — sits inside this
# git tree. None of the patterns above match this name, which left the
# deployment's checkout permanently dirty and the secret one `git add .` away
# from being committed.
/agent-home.env

